  "goodToKnow": "Das Taschenbuch is a paperback, literally a pocket book; the hardback is die gebundene Ausgabe or das Hardcover. Germany has fixed book prices by law (die Buchpreisbindung), so a book costs the same everywhere, online or in a shop, which helps keep small bookshops alive. The small yellow Reclam booklets are a famous school classic. Plural: die Taschenbücher."
